  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can tap into your inner spiritual strength.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Ki Meditation<sup>WK</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Once per day, after meditating or resting for 8 hours, you gain a ki pool containing a number of ki points equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum 1). As long as you have at least 1 point in your ki pool, you gain a +3 insight bonus to your chosen skill, which you can double to +6 as a free action by expending 1 point from your ki pool.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> If you gain levels in a class that grants a ki pool, you can immediately retrain this feat for a different ki feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-ki-feats#toc36\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
